      "html": "<section data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r=\"\"> <h2 class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-4\" style=\"color: var(--text-primary);\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r=\"\">The Waveform</h2> <p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed\" style=\"color: var(--text-secondary);\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r=\"\">\nThe background canvas draws a stacked-line waveform modeled after the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Unknown_Pleasures#Artwork_and_design\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"underline underline-offset-2 transition-colors duration-200\" style=\"color: var(--text-secondary); text-decoration-color: var(--border-hover);\" data-astro-cid-kh7btl4r=\"\">Unknown Pleasures</a> album cover by Joy Division, itself a plot of radio pulses from the pulsar CP 1919. Each row is filled beneath its curve to occlude the row behind it, producing the same layered depth as the original. The waveform is continuously animated with layered sine functions that shift over time.\n</p> </section>",
